@startuml
title Extended Finite State Machine (EFSM) - Communication Protocol

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<normal>> White
  BorderColor<<normal>> Black
  FontSize 13
}

state "Idle" as Idle
state "Receiving" as Receiving
state "Processing" as Processing
state "Sending" as Sending
state "WaitingAck" as WaitingAck

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> Receiving : packet_arrival / "store packet"
Receiving --> Processing : packet_complete / "validate"
Processing --> Sending : valid / "send packet"
Processing --> Idle : invalid / "discard"
Sending --> WaitingAck : sent / "start timer"
WaitingAck --> Idle : ack_received / "stop timer"
WaitingAck --> Sending : timeout / "retransmit"

note right of Idle : Extended variables:\nsequence_number, timeout_counter
note right of Processing : Three-stage processing:\ninput → process → output
note right of WaitingAck : Timer‑based retransmission

@enduml
